<title>USA: Smith Barney wins $69 mln NYS Environmental revs.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins $69 mln NYS Environmental revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State Environmental Facilities Corp. said it won $69 million of New York State Environmental Facilities Corporation state water pollution control revolving fund revenue bonds Series 1997 C, with a 5.08 pecrent.</p>
